DESCRIPTION:Thursday 19 November at 2:00 PM. At the Mess Hall\, 2240 Craig Side Road\, Carp. The event will start with our Annual General Meeting at which the directors for 2027 will be elected. \nThe AGM will be followed by Peg Blair who will speak about “The History of Street Names and Hamlets in Huntley Township.” Refreshments will be served. Free will donations appreciated. Everyone welcome.
