SUMMARY:Streetsville Historical Society November General Meeting: Ted Barris
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Ted Barris \nBreaking the Silence: Veterans’ untold stories from the Great War to Afghanistan \nA powerful testament to those who have sacrificed so much in the service of our country. Ted has put a face on the service and sacrifice of men and women in uniform. \nTed is a broadcaster and journalist. He is the award-winning author of over 20 books. Ted is the recipient of the Order of Canada for his lifetime of dedication in shining a light on the contributions of Canadians in times of conflict. \nNo Fee/Refreshments provided – Everyone welcome \nFood Bank donations to: Giving Without Expectations \nFor more information: streetsville.info@gmail.com
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/streetsville-historical-society-november-general-meeting-ted-barris/
LOCATION:Streetsville Legion Branch 139\, 101 Church Street\, Mississauga\, Ontario\, L5M 1M6\, Canada
ORGANIZER;CN="Streetsville Historical Society":MAILTO:streetsville.info@gmail.com
