SUMMARY:Guelph Black Heritage Society - Celebrate Give & Groove 2026 Holiday Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Give & Groove – GBHS Holiday Fundraiser Featuring Andrew Craig and Special Guests \nThe Guelph Black Heritage Society invites you to join us on Saturday\, November 21\, 2026\, for an evening of live music\, community\, and celebration at our annual Holiday Fundraiser. Featuring acclaimed musician Andrew Craig and special guest performers\, this event brings together supporters and friends for a memorable night in support of Black heritage\, culture\, and education in our community. \nGuests will enjoy outstanding live entertainment\, delicious appetizers\, and refreshments provided by Open Appetite Catering. \nMost importantly\, your attendance helps support GBHS programs\, educational initiatives\, cultural events\, and community outreach activities throughout the year. \nTickets\n$75 Friends of GBHS & WCBHS\n$85 General Admission \nWhether you’re a longtime supporter or joining us for the first time\, we look forward to welcoming you for an evening of music\, fellowship\, and community spirit! \nReserve Your Seat Today \nSeating is limited and advance tickets are encouraged.
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/guelph-black-heritage-society-celebrate-give-groove-2026-holiday-fundraiser/
LOCATION:Guelph Little Theatre\, 176 Morris Street\, Guelph\, ON\, N1E 5M7\, Canada
ORGANIZER;CN="Guelph Black Heritage Society":MAILTO:marketing.gbhs@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
