SUMMARY:Albion Bolton Historical Society Meeting: "The Orange and the Green; Separating Fact From Fiction"
DESCRIPTION:The Albion Bolton Historical Society’s next meeting is on Monday\, November 23\, 2026 for a start time of 7:30 pm. PLEASE NOTE we are now meeting at Rotary Place\, Caledon Senior’s Centre\, 7 Rotarian Way\, Bolton\, Multi-purpose Room 2\, located behind the Caledon Wellness Centre on the North Hill. Author and historian Ken Weber will present The Orange and the Green; Separating Fact From Fiction. Please visit us at boltonhistory.com
