SUMMARY:The Thunder Bay Historical Museum Society - Free Lecture on Herbarium History
DESCRIPTION:You are warmly invited to the Thunder Bay Museum for our Free Public Lecture with Myles Cummins\, Pressed in Time: The History of the Claude E. Garton Herbarium. \nDiscover how this remarkable local herbarium preserves stories of our environment and community\, with the option to attend in person at the Museum or join us online via Zoom. \nWhether you are curious about local history\, conservation\, or the natural world\, we would be delighted to have you with us on November 24 at 7:30 PM.
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/the-thunder-bay-historical-museum-society-free-lecture-on-herbarium-history/
