SUMMARY:Culinary Historians of Canada: Vanilla - The History of an Extraordinary Bean
DESCRIPTION:A fascinating look at the history of the world’s only edible orchid. A history framed by the commodity chain\, and culinary and cultural history. Join us for a presentation by award-winning author and University of Toronto history professor Eric Jennings. \nMonday\, November 30\n7:30 – 9:00 pm EST\non Zoom \nTickets on sale through Eventbrite (click on link)\n$15.00 members & students\n$20.00 CTA members\n$23.50 general admission\n(plus service charge)
